      <div xml:id="gom-Isam30">
        <head xml:id="gom-Isam30-Hd1e98">Caput 30</head>
        <div xml:id="gom-Isam30-Dd1e100">
          <head xml:id="gom-Isam30-Hd1e102">Versus 1</head>
          <p xml:id="gom-Isam30-d1e104">
            <quote xml:id="gom-Isam30-Qd1e106" type="lemma" source="http://scta.info/resource/Isam30_1">Cumque Amalecitae. (GREG., lib. XXIX <pb ed="#P" n="0562C"/> Moral.)</quote>
            <!-- check: lemma not matched to verse text -->
            <quote xml:id="gom-Isam30-Qd1e113"><seg type="qs">Considerandum est quid sit quod Amalecitae Siceleg invadunt et praedam capiunt</seg>, etc., usque ad <seg type="qs">quos communiter mundus habere despexit.</seg></quote>
          </p>
        </div>
        <div xml:id="gom-Isam30-Dd1e122">
          <head xml:id="gom-Isam30-Hd1e124">Versus 21</head>
          <p xml:id="gom-Isam30-d1e126">
            <quote xml:id="gom-Isam30-Qd1e128" type="lemma" source="http://scta.info/resource/Isam30_21@9-9">Substiterant.</quote>
            Ducenti lassi viri, qui cum sarcinis sunt relicti, significant infirmos Ecclesiae, qui cum spiritualibus viris currere nequeunt in via, sed quia fidem habent et opus bonum servant, a Christo praemium beatitudinis cum perfectis praecipiunt.
          </p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </body>
